{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29169","headline":"送薛秀才南游 · 许浑","name":"送薛秀才南游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"姑苏城外柳初凋，同上江楼更寂寥。\n遶壁旧诗尘漠漠，对窗寒竹雨潇潇。\n怜君别路随秋鴈，尽我离觞任晚潮。\n从此草玄应有处，白云青嶂一相招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}